<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<definitions xmlns="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20191111/MODEL/" xmlns:dmndi="https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20191111/DMNDI/" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20180521/DC/" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/20180521/DI/" id="Allowance_determination" name="2.3.3 Overhead, contingency and escalation" namespace="http://tim-method.example/utility-wam/1.0" exporter="Utility WAM Industry Process Reference" exporterVersion="2026-08-28">
  <description>Called from 2.3-estimate-work.bpmn as a business rule task. The published method gives how to determine contingency and escalation, not what the values should be. The VALUES in this table are firm judgment and must be reviewed against outturn; the structure is not.</description>
  <inputData id="in_estimateClass" name="Estimate class"><variable id="in_estimateClass_v" name="Estimate class" typeRef="string"/></inputData>
  <inputData id="in_riskProfile" name="Risk profile"><variable id="in_riskProfile_v" name="Risk profile" typeRef="string"/></inputData>
  <inputData id="in_contingencyMethod" name="Contingency method"><variable id="in_contingencyMethod_v" name="Contingency method" typeRef="string"/></inputData>
  <inputData id="in_deliveryMonths" name="Delivery period in months"><variable id="in_deliveryMonths_v" name="Delivery period in months" typeRef="number"/></inputData>
  <knowledgeSource id="ks_aace" name="AACE 96R-18 / 97R-18 / 40R-08 / 119R-21 / 10S-90"><description>Estimate classification for transmission and distribution (96R-18, which explicitly covers distribution and excludes substations) and for pipeline (97R-18); contingency by expected value (40R-08) and from parametric risk models (119R-21); 10S-90 defines contingency as an amount added for items, conditions or events for which the state, occurrence or effect is uncertain. AACE recommended practices are guidelines, not standards, and none is ANSI-recognised.</description></knowledgeSource>
  <knowledgeSource id="ks_ferc_oh" name="18 CFR Part 101 Electric Plant Instruction 4(B)"><description>Overhead may not be charged by adding an arbitrary percentage or amount to direct construction cost. It is allocated on a defined basis or not at all.</description></knowledgeSource>
  <decision id="d_2_3_3" name="Allowance determination">
    <description>2.3.3. Overhead treatment is separate and is constrained by Electric Plant Instruction 4(B): no arbitrary percentage on direct construction cost. Contingency covers items whose state, occurrence or effect is uncertain; it is not a buffer for scope that is known but unpriced.</description>
    <variable id="d_2_3_3_v" name="Allowance determination" typeRef="string"/>
    <informationRequirement id="ir_d_2_3_3_in_estimateClass"><requiredInput href="#in_estimateClass"/></informationRequirement>
    <informationRequirement id="ir_d_2_3_3_in_riskProfile"><requiredInput href="#in_riskProfile"/></informationRequirement>
    <informationRequirement id="ir_d_2_3_3_in_contingencyMethod"><requiredInput href="#in_contingencyMethod"/></informationRequirement>
    <informationRequirement id="ir_d_2_3_3_in_deliveryMonths"><requiredInput href="#in_deliveryMonths"/></informationRequirement>
    <authorityRequirement id="ar_d_2_3_3"><requiredAuthority href="#ks_aace"/></authorityRequirement>
    <decisionTable id="d_2_3_3_dt" hitPolicy="FIRST" preferredOrientation="Rule-as-Row">
      <input id="d_2_3_3_i1" label="Estimate class"><inputExpression id="d_2_3_3_i1_e" typeRef="string"><text>in_estimateClass</text></inputExpression></input>
      <input id="d_2_3_3_i2" label="Risk profile"><inputExpression id="d_2_3_3_i2_e" typeRef="string"><text>in_riskProfile</text></inputExpression></input>
      <input id="d_2_3_3_i3" label="Contingency method"><inputExpression id="d_2_3_3_i3_e" typeRef="string"><text>in_contingencyMethod</text></inputExpression></input>
      <input id="d_2_3_3_i4" label="Delivery period in months"><inputExpression id="d_2_3_3_i4_e" typeRef="number"><text>in_deliveryMonths</text></inputExpression></input>
      <output id="d_2_3_3_o" label="Allowance determination" name="Allowance determination" typeRef="string"/>
      <rule id="d_2_3_3_r1">
        <description>Short, fully defined and priced work. Adding contingency here only obscures the variance.</description>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r1_ie1"><text>"class1"</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r1_ie2"><text>"low"</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r1_ie3"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r1_ie4"><text>&lt;= 6</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r1_oe"><text>"noAllowance"</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_2_3_3_r2">
        <description>Determined from the identified risks by expected value or parametric model, not from the class. AACE 40R-08 and 119R-21.</description>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r2_ie1"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r2_ie2"><text>"high","complex"</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r2_ie3"><text>"riskBased"</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r2_ie4"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r2_oe"><text>"riskBasedContingency"</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_2_3_3_r3">
        <description>Early definition. The accuracy range is wide by construction and the contingency must reflect it rather than a target.</description>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r3_ie1"><text>"class5","class4"</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r3_ie2"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r3_ie3"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r3_ie4"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r3_oe"><text>"classBasedWide"</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_2_3_3_r4">
        <description>Class 3 is the common utility authorisation gate.</description>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r4_ie1"><text>"class3","class2","class1"</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r4_ie2"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r4_ie3"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r4_ie4"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r4_oe"><text>"classBasedNarrow"</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_2_3_3_r5">
        <description>Escalation is determined separately by index over the stated delivery period. A long period without an escalation allowance is an unstated assumption.</description>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r5_ie1"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r5_ie2"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r5_ie3"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r5_ie4"><text>&gt; 24</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r5_oe"><text>"classBasedPlusEscalation"</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
      <rule id="d_2_3_3_r6">
        <description>Held for the estimating owner rather than defaulted to a percentage.</description>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r6_ie1"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r6_ie2"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r6_ie3"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <inputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r6_ie4"><text>-</text></inputEntry>
        <outputEntry id="d_2_3_3_r6_oe"><text>"determineManually"</text></outputEntry>
      </rule>
    </decisionTable>
  </decision>
  <dmndi:DMNDI>
    <dmndi:DMNDiagram id="drd_Allowance_determination">
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_in_estimateClass" dmnElementRef="in_estimateClass"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="420" width="160" height="45"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_in_riskProfile" dmnElementRef="in_riskProfile"><dc:Bounds x="245" y="420" width="160" height="45"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_in_contingencyMethod" dmnElementRef="in_contingencyMethod"><dc:Bounds x="430" y="420" width="160" height="45"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_in_deliveryMonths" dmnElementRef="in_deliveryMonths"><dc:Bounds x="615" y="420" width="160" height="45"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_d_2_3_3" dmnElementRef="d_2_3_3"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="240" width="180" height="70"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_ks_aace" dmnElementRef="ks_aace"><dc:Bounds x="900" y="100" width="160" height="55"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
      <dmndi:DMNShape id="sh_ks_ferc_oh" dmnElementRef="ks_ferc_oh"><dc:Bounds x="1080" y="100" width="160" height="55"/></dmndi:DMNShape>
    </dmndi:DMNDiagram>
  </dmndi:DMNDI>
</definitions>
